000248                     MOVE HIGH-VALUES   TO WS-CHAVE-PAGTO
000249                  NOT AT END
000250                     ADD 1              TO WS-QTD-PAG-LIDOS
000251                     MOVE PG-NUM-CARTAO TO WS-CHAVE-PAGTO
000252             END-READ
000253
000254             IF NOT WS-FS-PAG-OK AND NOT WS-FS-PAG-FIM
000255                DISPLAY 'FATCONCI - ERRO DE READ PAGAMENTOS (PAGIN)'
000256                DISPLAY 'FS: ' WS-FS-PAGTO
000257                PERFORM 9900-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
000258                   THRU 9900-FIM-ENCERRAR-COM-ERRO
000259             END-IF.
000260
